gin{aligned}1 & 0 & -1 & 0 \\\\ 1 & 0 & 1 & 2\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}[\\begin{aligned}1 & 1 \\\\ -1 & 1\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}1 & 0 & -1 & 0 \\\\ 1 & 0 & 1 & 2\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}[\\begin{aligned}2 & 0 & 0 & 2 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 2 & 2\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}1 & 0 & 0 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 1 & 1\\end{aligned}].\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nAs a result, the coordinates of $P$ are $(1,0),(0,0),(0,1),(1,1).$\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"II only.\"" 13194139534504 true] [17592186292367 1000 #edb/ref 17592186292368 13194139534504 true] [17592186292367 1000 #edb/ref 17592186292369 13194139534504 true] [17592186292367 1000 #edb/ref 17592186292370 13194139534504 true] [17592186292367 1000 #edb/ref 17592186292371 13194139534504 true] [17592186292367 1000 #edb/ref 17592186292372 13194139534504 true] [17592186292367 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139534504 true] [17592186292367 1041 "selection" 13194139534504 true] [17592186292367 1104 #edb/ref 17592186292372 13194139534504 true] [17592186292367 1110 #uuid "90d05ff4-b74f-5e7e-a6fe-cb615b2a22f8" 13194139534504 true] [17592186292368 1034 "I and III only" 13194139534504 true] [17592186292368 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139534504 true] [17592186292368 1111 #uuid "66a7f402-aecc-5624-9d20-8866c52765a4" 13194139534504 true] [17592186292369 1034 "I only" 13194139534504 true] [17592186292369 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139534504 true] [17592186292369 1111 #uuid "e49af0fc-933e-5e31-ace0-05d5066b6079" 13194139534504 true] [17592186292370 1034 "III only" 13194139534504 true] [17592186292370 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139534504 true] [17592186292370 1111 #uuid "12cf6aa2-2da2-5697-b58b-18c03200ffd0" 13194139534504 true] [17592186292371 1034 "I and II only" 13194139534504 true] [17592186292371 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139534504 true] [17592186292371 1111 #uuid "2b8971b1-0e3a-5c9f-b154-e0e170c86f30" 13194139534504 true] [17592186292372 1034 "II only" 13194139534504 t