=\\frac{1}{2}[\\begin{aligned}-1 & -1 \\\\ -1 & 1\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}0 & -2 & -4 & -2 \\\\ 0 & -2 & 0 & 2\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}[\\begin{aligned}0 & 4 & 4 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 4 & 4\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}0 & 2 & 2 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 2 & 2\\end{aligned}].\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nAs a result, the coordinates of $P$ are $(0,0),(2,0),(2,2),(0,2).$\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"I only.\"" 13194139534504 true] [17592186292374 1000 #edb/ref 17592186292375 13194139534504 true] [17592186292374 1000 #edb/ref 17592186292376 13194139534504 true] [17592186292374 1000 #edb/ref 17592186292377 13194139534504 true] [17592186292374 1000 #edb/ref 17592186292378 13194139534504 true] [17592186292374 1000 #edb/ref 17592186292379 13194139534504 true] [17592186292374 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139534504 true] [17592186292374 1041 "selection" 13194139534504 true] [17592186292374 1104 #edb/ref 17592186292376 13194139534504 true] [17592186292374 1110 #uuid "850c9b75-2ef4-50bb-b318-e7c715fa2551" 13194139534504 true] [17592186292375 1034 "I and III only" 13194139534504 true] [17592186292375 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139534504 true] [17592186292375 1111 #uuid "85ebb2e0-8fc1-53fc-bd4e-356ec90e9e29" 13194139534504 true] [17592186292376 1034 "I only" 13194139534504 true] [17592186292376 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139534504 true] [17592186292376 1111 #uuid "51206799-2172-5b47-8976-14bb1ad69099" 13194139534504 true] [17592186292377 1034 "III only" 13194139534504 true] [17592186292377 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139534504 true] [17592186292377 1111 #uuid "9fca94a1-8b3e-5011-9092-e5f4b84852c2" 13194139534504 true] [17592186292378 1034 "I and II only" 13194139534504 true] [17592186292378 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139534504 true] [17592186292378 1111 #uuid "c9d1e822-05ff-5139-9d96-cb56b4228ac9" 13194139534504 true] [17592186292379 1034 "II only" 13194139534504 true] [17592186292379 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139534504 